      "decision": "Worktrees owns placement and read-only inventory; Git lifecycle and the adopter own separately authorized creation, repair and cleanup effects. Upgrade managed adoption in one material ticket. Adopt the new required minimal ticket shape in the target-owned manifest while preserving other repository extensions. The integration workstream owns the exact target adoption manifest and anchored ignore configuration for this user-authorized rollout; declare these paths explicitly rather than claim them through arbitrary broad managed exclusions.",
